0..78 Comment "// The peer\'s cancellation hop: the scope\'s clause abandons the rest while its"
79..145 Comment "// peer still owes a send, and the peer\'s next action observes the"
146..224 Comment "// cancellation and abandons its own rest (Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova,"
225..302 Comment "// _Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types_, POPL 2019, doi:10.1145/3290341)."
303..379 Comment "// No session action runs in the machine yet, so the program checks and does"
380..391 Comment "// not run."
393..467 Comment "/// A peer cancelled at its next action. It runs to 7 once session actions"
468..499 Comment "/// run in the machine (#1380)."
